  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "A capacitor has capacitance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#181;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math>&nbsp;when its parallel plates are separated by air medium of thickness <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi></math>. A slab of material of dielectric constant <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math> having area equal to that of plates but thickness&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;inserted between the plates. Capacitance of the capacitor in the presence of slab will be ______&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#181;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math>.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "6",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/bdc3a492-a556-4f49-be20-a0a29e01768c-9894736.PNG\" style=\"width: 177px; height: 136px;\" /></p><p>Capacitance of the parallel plate capacitor when air is present <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#1013;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>A</mi></mrow><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;F</mi></math></p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/75dc6166-04ec-4548-be17-e6122fbb732f-9894736_1.PNG\" style=\"width: 223px; height: 156px;\" /></p><p>After insertion of dielectric, the equivalent capacitance of the new capacitor is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>eq</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#1013;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mn>1</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;F</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;F</mi></math>.</p>",
